  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tbsp olive oil in a large Dutch oven or deep 12 inch skillet over medium-high heat. Add the onion and cook 4 minutes, until soft.",
    "Stir in the garlic and eggplant. Cook 6 to 8 minutes, stirring often, until the eggplant starts to brown at the edges.",
    "Add the bell pepper and zucchini. Cook 3 minutes.",
    "Pour in the diced tomatoes with their juice. Add the thyme, 1 tsp salt, and the pepper, and stir well.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low, cover partly, and simmer 20 minutes. The vegetables should be very tender and the sauce thick.",
    "While the stew simmers, bring the water and 1 tsp salt to a boil in a medium pot. Slowly whisk in the cornmeal in a thin stream.",
    "Lower heat to low and cook 20 to 25 minutes, stirring every few minutes, until the polenta is thick and creamy and pulls away from the pot.",
    "Taste the ratatouille and add more salt if needed. Spoon the polenta into four bowls and top with the ratatouille."
  ],
